---
// "Mine" and "everyone else", in the colours every commit chart uses for them.
---

<ul class="mt-3 flex gap-4 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-faint">
	<li class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
		<span class="h-2 w-3 bg-accent opacity-70"></span>Mine
	</li>
	<li class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
		<span class="h-2 w-3 bg-mute opacity-40"></span>Everyone else
	</li>
</ul>
